{"catalog_version": 1, "point_id": "NP-1", "task_id": "corpus-基于深度学习的四川盆地丘陵区县域耕地遥感识别研究-NP-1-A-1-zh", "fields": {"claim": "b987bf7b8b07bb96b71dea3a1e13400aab17478c9eb24f844be070e14bb27aaf", "claim_en": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "technical_features[0]": "fba416302fd72d9279df995b5098bbea0cb6b74cf262170f0ecbc58342f2a795", "technical_features[1]": "b759038785a953437d72b9c37e38760a913e72526220f66faf285c49ee3d3502", "technical_features[2]": "25d19514db4617e3e091d5db0b65556c78ea337cba2184d795fd8e0b2384207f"}, "sources": [{"source_id": "S-2f7ae42c6f7d64f2-001", "field": "claim", "field_index": null, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 60, "text": "面向四川盆地丘陵县域耕地识别，将高分六号影像的光谱与地形特征融合后用于UNet++耕地提取，并对比仅使用光谱特征的方案。", "sha256": "b987bf7b8b07bb96b71dea3a1e13400aab17478c9eb24f844be070e14bb27aaf"}, {"source_id": "S-2f7ae42c6f7d64f2-002", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 0, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 23, "text": "以高分六号高分辨率遥感影像开展三台县耕地识别。", "sha256": "fba416302fd72d9279df995b5098bbea0cb6b74cf262170f0ecbc58342f2a795"}, {"source_id": "S-2f7ae42c6f7d64f2-003", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 1, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 53, "text": "比较UNet++、DeeplabV3+、UNet、PSPNet、随机森林与SinoLC-1产品的识别效果。", "sha256": "b759038785a953437d72b9c37e38760a913e72526220f66faf285c49ee3d3502"}, {"source_id": "S-2f7ae42c6f7d64f2-004", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 2, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 31, "text": "将光谱与地形特征融合输入UNet++，并与仅光谱输入进行对比。", "sha256": "25d19514db4617e3e091d5db0b65556c78ea337cba2184d795fd8e0b2384207f"}]}